# Ahead-of-time Neural Engine models (decision 0096 §3): one constant file a line, relative to this directory.
#
# Each file is a fixed relation's rows in the RRBITS01 layout (accel/src/ane/package.rs: the magic, rows and words
# as u64, then the rows' words, little-endian). The build step (accel/build/ane.rs) writes and compiles its bit
# product model and embeds it in the executable; the lane uses it before compiling one at run time.
# Empty by default: models compiled at run time are kept as facts in the engine's content store instead.
